The '''Library''' is located in the {{Zone|Village}} within the {{Zone|Combat Settlement}}. Inside it, players can find an {{Item|Enchantment Table}} and the {{NPCSprite|Librarian}}, who sells {{Item|Enchanted Book}}s and {{Item|Experience Bottle}}s.

{{ZoneText|Talk to the Librarian.|Enchant your items.}}

